          },
          "verifiedOn": "2026-10-18",
          "reviewer": "research-agent (pending legal review)",
          "notes": "Finlex lists government proposal HE 129/2026; EUR-Lex lists no notified Finnish measures (checked 2026-10-18). Proposed entry into force 1 January 2027 per government release (valtioneuvosto.fi returned 403 and is not on the allow-list) — not modelled."
        }
